sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Manager/User Client
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant Z as AuthZ Service
    participant C as TrendsController
    participant R as Shared Redis Cluster
    participant MR as Metrics Repository
    participant S as Session Repository
    participant US as Usage Service

    Note over M,C: Fetch user trends for sessions, scores, and AI usage\nInputs: orgId, userId, from, to, granularity (hour/day/week)

    M->>G: GET /users/{userId}/trends?orgId=&from=&to=&granularity=
    G->>Z: authorize(subject, action=read_trends, resource=userId)
    alt authorized
        Z-->>G: allow
        G->>C: Forward request (orgId, userId, from, to, granularity)

        C->>R: GET cache["user_trends", userId, from, to, granularity]
        alt cache hit
            R-->>C: cached timeseries
            C-->>G: 200 OK + timeseries
            G-->>M: 200 OK + timeseries
        else cache miss
            par session counts timeseries
                C->>MR: getUserSessionSeries(userId, from, to, granularity)
                MR-->>C: sessionSeries[]
            and scores timeseries
                C->>MR: getUserScoreSeries(userId, from, to, granularity)
                MR-->>C: scoreSeries[]
            and AI usage timeseries
                C->>US: getUserAiUsageSeries(userId, from, to, granularity)
                US-->>C: {tokensSeries[], callsSeries[]}
            end

            Note over C: Post-process: align buckets, fill gaps, compute rolling averages
            C->>R: SET cache["user_trends", userId, from, to, granularity] = timeseries TTL=15m
            C-->>G: 200 OK + timeseries
            G-->>M: 200 OK + timeseries
        end
    else forbidden
        Z-->>G: deny
        G-->>M: 403 Forbidden
    end
